# Docker build context filter.
# All service Dockerfiles build from the repo root: `docker build -f <svc-dir>/Dockerfile .`
# (<svc-dir> = services/<svc>/, gateway/, or edge/<svc>/; see Makefile). COPY
# instructions reference services/ + gateway/ + edge/ + framework/ — everything
# else is dead weight in the build context.
# Ref: https://docs.docker.com/build/building/best-practices/#exclude-with-dockerignore

# Version control
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.gitmodules

# Python
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/*.egg-info
**/node_modules
**/uv.lock

# Claude Code / IDE / editor
.claude/
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/*.swp
**/*.swo
**/*~

# Root-level files not needed by any COPY instruction
/*.md
/*.toml
/*.lock
/Makefile
/sif
